```

---

### 场景 3: 研究助手（带工具）

```typescript
const orchestrator = new OpenMultiAgent();

// 注册工具
registerBuiltInTools(orchestrator, {
  bash: true,
  file_read: true,
  web_search: true  // 假设有 web 搜索工具
});

const agent = {
  name: 'research-agent',
  model: 'claude-opus-4-6',
  systemPrompt: 'You research topics using available tools.',
  tools: ['web_search', 'file_read', 'bash']  // 代理可以使用这些工具
};

const result = await orchestrator.runAgent(
  agent,
  'Research the latest trends in AI agent frameworks.'
